            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Thuan Kieu",
            "review_text": "hoang vu n\n1 contribution\n0\nIt feels forced.\nNov 2023 • Family\nDelicious food. But the customer service is a bit rude. Order a bowl of sour fish soup with howling fish, the staff writes down the order clearly, then brings out the bowl of sour snakehead fish soup. Asked the staff to exchange it and was told that exchanges are not allowed here? I wonder whose fault it is? Then force the customer to eat and pay for that dish. Please review the restaurant's service. This time I really couldn't stand it, so I came here to say it.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten November 5, 2023",
